cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "Noah: An Open-Source Framework for Evolutionary and Genetic Programming"

version: 1.0.0.0

message: "If you use Noah in your research, please cite this software."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "MAUKOSKI"
    given-names: "W. X."

repository-code: "https://github.com/maukoski/Noah"

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22314944"

abstract: >
  Noah is an open-source framework for evolutionary and genetic programming
  designed to provide an extensible evolutionary infrastructure while allowing
  complete freedom in genotype representation.

keywords:
  - genetic programming
  - evolutionary computation
  - genetic algorithms
  - optimization
  - selection strategies
